---
import LegalLayout from '../layouts/LegalLayout.astro';
---

<LegalLayout title="Prohibited Items">
  <h1>Prohibited items</h1>
  <p class="legal-notice">This list is pending final operational and legal review. Always check the latest version before creating a parcel.</p>

  <section>
    <h2>General rule</h2>
    <p>Khepia only supports non-dutiable, permitted personal items. If you are unsure whether an item can be sent, do not include it in your parcel until you have confirmed with Khepia support.</p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>You must not send or carry</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Weapons, explosives, or ammunition</li>
      <li>Illegal drugs or controlled substances</li>
      <li>Hazardous materials or flammable goods</li>
      <li>Perishable food items requiring cold chain</li>
      <li>Live animals or plants</li>
      <li>Currency, precious metals, or high-value jewelry</li>
      <li>Counterfeit or pirated goods</li>
      <li>Items prohibited by UAE, Saudi Arabia, or Pakistan customs</li>
      <li>Any item the sender cannot accurately declare</li>
      <li>Items exceeding customs duty-free thresholds without proper documentation</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Passenger responsibility</h2>
    <p>The traveller is responsible for the contents of their baggage. Passengers must inspect parcels before accepting them and must never accept an unopened or suspicious parcel.</p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Questions?</h2>
    <p>Contact <a href="https://wa.me/0000000000">WhatsApp support</a> or <a href="mailto:support@khepia.pk">email support</a> before sending anything you're unsure about.</p>
  </section>
</LegalLayout>
